        how: "Move 20 tickets from TICKETRON 2009 to FlowSphere Cloud. Export a ticket at the old terminal, carry it across the room and fill in the new tool's mandatory fields; the ticket's text has the answers. A wrong pick is a validation error and a few seconds of spinner. Pick with the buttons or keys 1-4.",
