                (id: 4032, text: "The printer only prints the last page. Of everything. Since 2019. Whenever you have time.",
                 fields: [("component", 0), ("urgency", 0), ("category", 0)]),
                (id: 4033, text: "The CEO's coffee machine makes tea. The CEO hates tea. A chat message, all caps.",
