        how: "24 hours in four minutes. The demo builds itself as fast as your focus allows, and focus drains all the time, twice as fast between 02:00 and 06:00. Walk over pizza boxes and energy drinks to refill it; they come back after a while, and nobody eats when already focused. At hour 24 you present on stage.",
